-- Kept on ASSUME deliberately (IMPLICIT-PROPS-DESIGN.md §11.1, R0: ASSUME is deprecated): l4 batch supplying a module-level ASSUME is the thing under test.
§ `Export reads an ASSUME directly`
ASSUME x IS A NUMBER

@export f adds y to the assumed x
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
f y MEANS x PLUS y
